    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41239" root="هضب" body-key="h">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هِضَبٌّ</span></b>  (tropical:)  A horse <i>sweating much;</i> or <i>that sweats
much.</i> (S, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>Hard,</i> or <i>firm, and strong,</i>
or <i>robust.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <i>Large,</i> or <i>bulky;</i> as an
epithet applied to the kind of lizard called <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَبّ</span>,
and to other things. (TA.)

